1
00:00:08,964 --> 00:00:12,108
Everything else has been
looked for, and not found.

2
00:00:12,188 --> 00:00:14,491
But surely not the one who finds.

3
00:00:15,304 --> 00:00:17,932
I am John Tan, known as Thusness.

4
00:00:18,012 --> 00:00:21,890
These are my own notes, from my
own practice and contemplation.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,937
In Parts 1 to 4, what appears was
looked for, and not found. Not a bell.

6
00:00:28,017 --> 00:00:30,192
Not a red. Not a thought.

7
00:00:30,272 --> 00:00:33,684
No floor in time, in matter, or in space.

8
00:00:33,764 --> 00:00:35,600
No privileged way of appearing.

9
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,928
And not the web of conditions either.

10
00:00:38,736 --> 00:00:40,454
One candidate is left.

11
00:00:40,534 --> 00:00:44,326
And the habit saves it for last, because
it seems to be the one doing all the

12
00:00:44,406 --> 00:00:45,606
looking.

13
00:00:45,988 --> 00:00:47,733
Every appearance is clear.

14
00:00:47,813 --> 00:00:49,649
The colour is seen as colour.

15
00:00:49,729 --> 00:00:51,619
The sound is heard as sound.

16
00:00:51,699 --> 00:00:53,385
The thought is known as thought.

17
00:00:53,465 --> 00:00:56,904
This clarity is not one more
kind of thing among the others.

18
00:00:56,984 --> 00:00:58,779
It runs through all appearing.

19
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:02,493
The solid, the dreamlike,
and the described alike.

20
00:01:03,296 --> 00:01:08,519
Surely, then, there is a light
behind it all. A knower. A witness.

21
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:12,568
A background awareness that receives
the appearances and lights them up.

22
00:01:12,648 --> 00:01:15,190
The one constant behind the changing show.

23
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:17,378
Everything else may be unfindable.

24
00:01:17,458 --> 00:01:19,760
But surely not the one who finds.

25
00:01:20,556 --> 00:01:21,756
Or look for it.

26
00:01:23,128 --> 00:01:26,694
Look at a tree. There is the
tree, and there is seeing.

27
00:01:26,774 --> 00:01:31,481
Now look for a viewer, standing
apart from both. It is not found.

28
00:01:32,276 --> 00:01:36,249
Listen to the bell. There is
the ringing, clear and complete.

29
00:01:36,329 --> 00:01:38,165
Look for a listener behind it.

30
00:01:38,245 --> 00:01:40,597
The ringing does not need one to be clear.

31
00:01:40,677 --> 00:01:42,880
The clarity is the appearing's own.

32
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:45,656
It is not borrowed from
a knower behind it.

33
00:01:46,464 --> 00:01:49,686
This is the observer
returning, in a quieter form,

34
00:01:49,766 --> 00:01:52,435
after anatta has taken it apart once.

35
00:01:52,515 --> 00:01:57,041
And it is the easiest place for a
new floor to grow. Pure awareness.

36
00:01:57,121 --> 00:01:59,541
The witness. The ground of being.

37
00:01:59,621 --> 00:02:01,891
Each sounds like a deep realisation.

38
00:02:01,971 --> 00:02:06,270
Each makes the clarity into a thing,
standing behind the appearing.

39
00:02:07,084 --> 00:02:09,209
But this is not only an argument.

40
00:02:09,289 --> 00:02:11,125
It is about something tasted.

41
00:02:11,205 --> 00:02:15,650
So I want to say, as plainly as I can,
what experience is like when there is no

42
00:02:15,730 --> 00:02:16,930
layer.

43
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,078
When no layer is left.

44
00:02:19,932 --> 00:02:22,868
If there is no substrate,
no layer underneath,

45
00:02:22,948 --> 00:02:24,720
what happens to experience?

46
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:28,294
The habit expects it to
grow thin. Or to vanish.

47
00:02:28,374 --> 00:02:30,101
It is the other way round.

48
00:02:30,181 --> 00:02:32,959
Nothing is lost, except the distance.

49
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:38,413
As long as a layer is assumed,
experience is always one step removed.

50
00:02:38,493 --> 00:02:42,964
There is me, in here. A
screen, or a mind, in between.

51
00:02:43,044 --> 00:02:45,029
And the world, out there.

52
00:02:45,109 --> 00:02:49,133
The sound reaches me through the ear,
is turned into a picture of sound,

53
00:02:49,213 --> 00:02:51,008
and is then known by someone.

54
00:02:51,088 --> 00:02:53,662
Every experience comes with a middleman.

55
00:02:54,476 --> 00:02:57,580
When the layer is seen
through, the middleman goes.

56
00:02:57,660 --> 00:03:00,392
Nothing stands between
the hearing and the sound,

57
00:03:00,472 --> 00:03:03,698
because there is no between
left for anything to stand in.

58
00:03:04,512 --> 00:03:07,371
The Buddha put it to
Bāhiya as a direct taste.

59
00:03:07,451 --> 00:03:09,504
In the seen, just the seen.

60
00:03:09,584 --> 00:03:11,665
In the heard, just the heard.

61
00:03:11,745 --> 00:03:14,871
Not a seer who sees the
seen. Just the seen.

62
00:03:14,951 --> 00:03:16,778
Vivid, and complete.

63
00:03:17,596 --> 00:03:22,194
So yes. It has to be direct,
and without anything in between.

64
00:03:22,274 --> 00:03:25,143
And the clarity is
exactly the appearances.

65
00:03:25,223 --> 00:03:29,980
Not a clarity that has sounds, or
contains colours, or shines on thoughts.

66
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,759
The ringing is the clarity.

67
00:03:31,839 --> 00:03:35,066
The red is the clarity.
The thought is the clarity.

68
00:03:35,864 --> 00:03:39,647
There is no knowing left over,
once the sound is fully heard.

69
00:03:39,727 --> 00:03:43,180
And no sound left over that the
knowing has not already been.

70
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:45,177
Knowing and known are not two.

71
00:03:45,257 --> 00:03:47,541
Not because they have
melted into one thing.

72
00:03:47,621 --> 00:03:51,363
But because they were never found
as two things in the first place.

73
00:03:52,164 --> 00:03:55,974
And the clarity is not one even
light, poured over everything.

74
00:03:56,054 --> 00:03:58,406
Each appearance is clear in its own way.

75
00:03:58,486 --> 00:04:00,594
The clarity of the bell is the ringing.

76
00:04:00,674 --> 00:04:02,944
The clarity of the red is redness.

77
00:04:03,024 --> 00:04:05,132
The clarity of an ache is aching.

78
00:04:05,212 --> 00:04:06,980
Sound never becomes colour.

79
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:08,827
Thought never becomes warmth.

80
00:04:08,907 --> 00:04:10,472
Intimate without merging.

81
00:04:10,552 --> 00:04:12,283
Distinct without walls.

82
00:04:13,096 --> 00:04:16,489
What is this like, in
taste? I can only point.

83
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:21,858
Vivid. Without a layer to soften
it, each appearance is fully itself.

84
00:04:21,938 --> 00:04:24,847
The bell rings with a brightness
that was always there,

85
00:04:24,927 --> 00:04:27,025
but used to be held at a distance.

86
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:31,650
Intimate. There is no gap
between here and there to cross.

87
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:35,061
The tree is not over there,
being seen from here.

88
00:04:35,141 --> 00:04:36,913
The scenery is the seeing.

89
00:04:37,708 --> 00:04:40,078
Without centre, and without edge.

90
00:04:40,158 --> 00:04:43,787
No point of view sits at the
middle of experience, looking out.

91
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:48,493
And experience has no border, where
it stops and the world begins.

92
00:04:49,304 --> 00:04:52,313
Effortless. Nobody is doing the hearing.

93
00:04:52,393 --> 00:04:54,663
Hearing happens when the conditions meet.

94
00:04:54,743 --> 00:04:57,195
And it is complete, without help.

95
00:04:57,996 --> 00:05:02,024
Self releasing. Each appearance
is complete, and gone.

96
00:05:02,104 --> 00:05:05,271
Like a drawing on water,
which needs no eraser.

97
00:05:05,351 --> 00:05:08,618
Nothing is kept, so
nothing needs to be let go.

98
00:05:09,424 --> 00:05:13,456
And one caution. Because this
is exactly where it goes wrong.

99
00:05:14,252 --> 00:05:18,212
A non dual experience can still
be held in a substantialist way.

100
00:05:18,292 --> 00:05:21,377
The split between knower
and known collapses.

101
00:05:21,457 --> 00:05:24,434
And then the openness that
is left, the pure presence,

102
00:05:24,514 --> 00:05:27,981
the luminous awareness,
quietly becomes the new floor.

103
00:05:28,061 --> 00:05:31,776
Luminosity takes the seat
that substance used to occupy.

104
00:05:32,592 --> 00:05:34,541
But the clarity is empty too.

105
00:05:34,621 --> 00:05:36,810
Looked for, it is not found.

106
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:38,861
And it is just as vivid for that.

107
00:05:38,941 --> 00:05:41,959
A taste that has no ground
under it does not need one.

108
00:05:42,039 --> 00:05:44,215
And the moment it is held as a possession,

109
00:05:44,295 --> 00:05:45,931
a layer has come back.

110
00:05:46,732 --> 00:05:50,189
The Dzogchen tradition has its
own words for this clarity.

111
00:05:50,269 --> 00:05:53,577
And I find them precious, when
they are read without a ground.

112
00:05:54,392 --> 00:05:58,094
Luminosity is not a bright
substance behind the display.

113
00:05:58,174 --> 00:06:01,001
It is the knowing clarity
of the display itself.

114
00:06:01,081 --> 00:06:03,827
Display is not the display
of something hidden.

115
00:06:03,907 --> 00:06:08,121
It is appearing, vivid and
unobstructed, with nothing behind it.

116
00:06:08,201 --> 00:06:11,694
Spontaneous presence is the
completeness of each appearance,

117
00:06:11,774 --> 00:06:13,786
owing nothing to a hidden source.

118
00:06:13,866 --> 00:06:16,535
And self release is the drawing on water.

119
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:19,805
I should say plainly
that this is a reading.

120
00:06:19,885 --> 00:06:24,683
Some in the Nyingma tradition speak of the
clear nature of mind as the basis itself,

121
00:06:24,763 --> 00:06:28,229
and set ordinary mind apart
from rigpa, as wisdom.

122
00:06:28,309 --> 00:06:31,340
They will find more in those
words than I take from them here.

123
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:34,058
I take them in the sense
that rules out a ground,

124
00:06:34,138 --> 00:06:36,182
because that is how I have come to see it.

125
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,144
And nothing is missing.
The tree is still seen.

126
00:06:40,224 --> 00:06:41,788
The bell is still heard.

127
00:06:41,868 --> 00:06:43,419
The thought is still known.

128
00:06:43,499 --> 00:06:48,043
Only the one standing behind them
is not found. And was never needed.

129
00:06:48,836 --> 00:06:50,432
So, which holds?

130
00:06:51,408 --> 00:06:56,740
By experience. Look at a tree.
Listen to the bell. Notice a thought.

131
00:06:56,820 --> 00:06:58,615
There is the tree and seeing.

132
00:06:58,695 --> 00:07:01,821
The ringing and hearing.
The thought and knowing.

133
00:07:01,901 --> 00:07:05,381
At no point is a viewer met,
standing apart from them,

134
00:07:05,461 --> 00:07:07,175
receiving them from behind.

135
00:07:07,255 --> 00:07:10,780
What is met is the clarity of
each appearance, in its own way.

136
00:07:11,596 --> 00:07:16,384
By logic. A knower standing behind
experience would have to be picked out.

137
00:07:16,464 --> 00:07:18,884
Picked out, it becomes
one more appearance,

138
00:07:18,964 --> 00:07:20,936
known by something further back.

139
00:07:21,016 --> 00:07:22,838
And the regress never ends.

140
00:07:22,918 --> 00:07:24,537
Or it is never picked out.

141
00:07:24,617 --> 00:07:27,607
And then nothing at all has
been found to stand there.

142
00:07:27,687 --> 00:07:30,424
Either way, no witness is established.

143
00:07:31,232 --> 00:07:36,156
By working. Seeing sees.
Hearing hears. Thinking thinks.

144
00:07:36,236 --> 00:07:38,901
And all of it works without
a viewer in the middle.

145
00:07:38,981 --> 00:07:43,729
The witness explains nothing that the
clarity of appearing does not already do.

146
00:07:44,532 --> 00:07:47,649
So the knower behind the
knowing is not the truer view.

147
00:07:47,729 --> 00:07:53,605
It is the default one, carried by habit,
and by one little word. The I in I see.

148
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:59,542
None of this makes my everyday words
false. I see the tree. I hear the bell.

149
00:07:59,622 --> 00:08:03,717
What fails is only the one standing
behind the seeing, holding it.

150
00:08:04,532 --> 00:08:08,818
This is Section 2, Part 5 of
the Dependent Arising series.

151
00:08:09,624 --> 00:08:13,271
In Part 6, I take up the
other side of the same taste.

152
00:08:13,351 --> 00:08:16,383
If there is no layer, and
yet everything depends,

153
00:08:16,463 --> 00:08:18,344
how can the seen be complete?

154
00:08:19,156 --> 00:08:21,377
That opens onto total exertion.

155
00:08:21,457 --> 00:08:24,289
And the next parts follow
it through four images.

